QUERY NAME: qryProjectYear
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT MY_tlkpProjectRadTrackData.Project, MY_tlkpProjectRadTrackData.Year
FROM MY_tlkpProjectRadTrackData INNER JOIN qryShowWhichProjects ON MY_tlkpProjectRadTrackData.Project = qryShowWhichProjects.Project
ORDER BY MY_tlkpProjectRadTrackData.Project, MY_tlkpProjectRadTrackData.Year;

